# Route: guide 27 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 45 to 47, 31
# quests, 1.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale): Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Ruins of Aboraz ->
# Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Ruins of Zul'Mamwe ->
# Mistvale Valley -> Nek'mani Wellspring -> Booty Bay.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Monogrammed Sash (620;
# Mok'rash 50); The Captain's Chest (8551; Gorlash 47); The Captain's Chest
# (614; Gorlash 47); Facing Negolash (618; Negolash 52); The Monogrammed Sash
# (8552; Mok'rash 50); Facing Negolash (8554; Negolash 52).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

